<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 5.617 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 5.617 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first four of seven auctions whereby it sought to drain 5.617 billion pesos from the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>700 mln    43 days  24.43 pct</p>
<p>700 mln    42 days  24.39 pct</p>
<p>1.000 bln  35 days  24.00 pct</p>
<p>1.000 bln  25 days  24.36 pct</p>
<p>1.000 bln  16 days</p>
<p>950 mln    10 days</p>
<p>267 mln     1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
